     1,
     "hello,everyone!please see this article,<a href=\"http://rpubs.com/kohske/dual_axis_in_ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rpubs.com/kohske/dual_axis_in_ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372372567000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GbbIbU3YM8F7gc7RtJI8o\">http://rpubs.com/kohske/dual_axis_in_ggplot2</a> .<div>as you can see,this paper had done a bold attemptt and get a nice plot.</div><div> i want to draw dual y axis with facet_wrap ,with the dataset mtcars,the code is below</div><div>(cause the code need learn grid and gtable packages,and I don not have too much time to spend in they ,so could someone nice to give me some help ) </div><div> </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">p1 &lt;- ggplot(mtcars, aes(mpg, disp)) + geom_line(colour = &quot;blue&quot;) + theme_bw()+facet_wrap(~vs)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">p2 &lt;- ggplot(mtcars, aes(mpg, drat)) + geom_line(colour = &quot;red&quot;) + theme_bw() %+replace%</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">theme(panel.background = element_rect(fill = NA))+facet_wrap(~vs)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"># extract gtable</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">g1 &lt;- ggplot_gtable(ggplot_build(p1))</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">g2 &lt;- ggplot_gtable(ggplot_build(p2))</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"># overlap the panel of 2nd plot on that of 1st plot</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">#pp &lt;- c(subset(g1$layout, name == &quot;panel&quot;, se = t:r))</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">pp &lt;- c(subset(g1$layout, name %in% g1$layout$name[2:3] , se = t:r))</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"># g &lt;- gtable_add_grob(g1, g2$grobs[[which(g2$layout$name == &quot;panel&quot;)]], pp$t,</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"># pp$l, pp$b, pp$l)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">g &lt;- gtable_add_grob(g1, g2$grobs[2:3], pp$t,</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">pp$l, pp$b, pp$l)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">#code below may be error,but with myslef dataset ,no error. I don not know why .</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ia &lt;- which(g2$layout$name %in% g2$layout$name[6:7])</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ga=list();ax=list()</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">for(i in 1:length(ia)){</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ga[[i]] &lt;- g2$grobs[[i+6-1]]</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ax[[i]] &lt;- ga[[i]]$children[[2]]</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ax[[i]]$widths &lt;- rev(ax[[i]]$widths)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ax[[i]]$grobs &lt;- rev(ax[[i]]$grobs)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">ax[[i]]$grobs[[1]]$x &lt;- ax[[i]]$grobs[[1]]$x - unit(1, &quot;npc&quot;) + unit(0.15, &quot;cm&quot;)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">}</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">g &lt;- gtable_add_cols(g, g2$widths[g2$layout[ia, ]$l], length(g$widths) - 1)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">g &lt;- gtable_add_grob(g, ax, pp$t, length(g$widths) - 1, pp$b)</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"># draw it</span><br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">grid.draw(g)</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:22px\">with myself dataset ,the plot is below.As you can notice,the rigth y axis is far-right .</span></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:22px\"><a href=\"http://ww3.sinaimg.cn/large/61830b46jw1e7akz02tpmj21hc0san7p.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ww3.sinaimg.cn/large/61830b46jw1e7akz02tpmj21hc0san7p.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372372567000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZrMmxB0HLn8nvNZJ2TrKI\">http://ww3.sinaimg.cn/large/61830b46jw1e7akz02tpmj21hc0san7p.jpg</a></span></font><br></div><div><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:22px\">how can i have a nice one </span></font></div>"
